{"ID":"20240511110538-rsqdvgf","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511110538-rsqdvgf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511110538-rsqdvgf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511114743-l7vdhnx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511132720-jbvae5k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513125600-bo04cyo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:31,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:31\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐-053号（风引汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240513125600"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511114743-l7vdhnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114743-l7vdhnx","updated":"20240511114743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中风之中有一种风瘫 , 症状是四肢无力 , 无法自行起坐 , 并不是一般的单侧瘫痪 , 身体发热 , 但不是高烧 , 言语困难 , 全身关节似乎无法伸缩 , 此类中风中医谓[风瘫] , 起因是行房事时感受风寒 , 或於出大汗时感受风寒所致 , 由於风寒是在人体出大汗毛孔大开时深入骨节之间而造成此[风瘫] , 因此服用此方时须要在无风的处所服用一段时间 , 要有黏稠的湿汗排出 , 此类汗为病汗 , 出量很慢才是对的 , 出得越多则力量恢复越快 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511114743-jo7ocdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114743-jo7ocdu","updated":"20240511114745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丸剂是取其药缓力专的特性 , 服用此药时忌讳吹风 , 须要有耐心的服用 , 因为此病无法快攻 , 药力过快 , 病人只有一般汗出 , 病汗不出於事无补 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511114743-mfxlzcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114743-mfxlzcq","updated":"20240511114753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服用方法 : 早中晚饭前30粒 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511114743-avfrjmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114743-avfrjmy","updated":"20240511114756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禁忌 : 无"}]},{"ID":"20240511132712-hnrl6u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132712-hnrl6u6"}},{"ID":"20240513125600-bo04cyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513125600-bo04cyo","updated":"20240513125600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"風引湯(中風癱瘓無力,尚可言語)，類似於仙豐製作的風引53號。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132713-d6ww56y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240511132713-d6ww56y"}},{"ID":"20240511132720-j0zvc7y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-j0zvc7y","updated":"20240511132722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-53　风引汤"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-cjbmvkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-cjbmvkl","updated":"20240511132720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2006.12.04B　录校：孟磊）"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-o0z2n7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-o0z2n7x","updated":"20240511132720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再讲汉唐五十三号 风引汤"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-gd9jt2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-gd9jt2v","updated":"20240511132720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是治疗风痱，千金方里面有大小续命."}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-4cj7h27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-4cj7h27","updated":"20240511154121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中风之中有一种风瘫 , 症状是四肢无力 , 无法自行起坐 , 并不是一般的单侧瘫痪，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-s5dqttb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-s5dqttb","updated":"20240511132720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左瘫右痪，全身不能动的叫痱."}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-0mytvvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-0mytvvb","updated":"20240511154122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"身体发热 , 但不是高烧 , 言语困难 , 全身关节似乎无法伸缩 , 此类中风中医谓[风瘫] , 起因是行房事时感受风寒 , 或于出大汗时感受风寒所致 , 由于风寒是在人体出大汗毛孔大开时深入骨节之间而造成此[风瘫] ,"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-lr7ib44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-lr7ib44","updated":"20240511132720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 另外还有一点在大汗后饮凉水，或雾天，或夏天早晨露水，过于辛劳后出汗后误入。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-mjid0l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-mjid0l8","updated":"20240511154125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因此服用此方时须要在无风的处所服用一段时间 , 要有黏稠的湿汗排出 ,."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-25fnrgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-25fnrgx","updated":"20240511132720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有湿寒风三者在一块入侵人的身体"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-nfflw0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-nfflw0z","updated":"20240511154128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"此类汗为病汗 , 出量很慢才是对的 , 出得越多则力量恢复越快 ."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-ihijqk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-ihijqk2","updated":"20240511132720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出得越多不是一时出的过多，不是一切发汗解表可治病，要使外部营卫合，这样才能去病，大量解表出大汗，反而伤营气，这叫大汗亡阳.这阳是表部，表气不守， 其卫营统失，伤寒里面时刻告诫注意不可大汗亡阳.看有些医师，大量麻黄，久吃，不把人虚了才怪.在我们书院里面，有个病号，就有出现亡阳的现象，甚至出现 阴阳离，人就会死去，大汗亡阳后，人就发精黄，身体疼痛，人身体处在兴奋状态，这都是大汗亡阳，仲圣一般都用龙骨牡蛎收敛，所以解表的办法也要注意，所谓 汗吐下三法不是随便用的，别人解表你也解，别人解行你不行，这种情况不走中路皆是外道，看到这种情况，气愤也没办法出，实际上也是病人的因缘，不撞南墙不 死心。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-0o87ivz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-0o87ivz","updated":"20240511154131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"丸剂是取其药缓力专的特性 , 服用此药时忌讳吹风 , 须要有耐心的服用 , 因为此病无法快攻 , 药力过快 , 病人只有一般汗出 , 病汗不出于事无补 ."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-ex89scj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-ex89scj","updated":"20240511154133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这只要是认真研究伤寒与金匮的，或伤寒杂病论的对这东西都清楚明白，就怕研究变成二百五。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132720-jbvae5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132720-jbvae5k","updated":"20240511154139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服用方法 : 早中晚饭前30粒 ."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]}]}